commit c0835b651fb376eb07921ce224e2cbccc5df0152
Author: Gabe Castro <gabe@techworx.dev>
Date:   Wed Nov 18 11:20:20 2026 -0800

    feat(config): name release targets once and infer the forge repository from origin

    [release] targets plus an asset-name template expand in config resolution into the artifacts they replace; an overlap with an explicit artifact is E197. forge-repository defaults to origin's GitHub repository everywhere, and init no longer asks for it or accepts --forge-repository. init writes targets and one template, with a Windows .zip kept as an explicit artifact.

    Entire-Checkpoint: 01M7R1MPH3Z8QA5QXTNA8GHBQM

